@MilitaryDraftSystem.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5008
@apiKey = dev-local-api-key
@citizenId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@officerId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Manually draft a citizen through a recruitment officer

POST {{MilitaryDraftSystem.API_HostAddress}}/draft/citizens/{{citizenId}}/officers/{{officerId}}
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Manually draft a citizen without an API key (expected: 401 Unauthorized)

POST {{MilitaryDraftSystem.API_HostAddress}}/draft/citizens/{{citizenId}}/officers/{{officerId}}

### Get a recruitment officer's draft history, morale and retirement status

GET {{MilitaryDraftSystem.API_HostAddress}}/draft/officers/{{officerId}}/stats
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

###
